print("    → the ceiling max2X(ℓ,k) is symmetric under k ↦ (4ℓ+2)−k, the reflection x ↦ max−x on one coordinate")
print("    → a symmetric non-constant function is non-monotone; §9.4 requires monotone; hence envelope. QED")

# ---- [23] gap decomposition per axis: how much is the fold, how much the congruence ----
